  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "edd64a0629af4b6f",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数 v1.0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29720c3d5685734b",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis Decision Index 对决策模型进行基准评测。决策模型是一类新型模型，能够在单次调用中对结构化决策给出答案，并提供每个选项的概率。1.0 版本结合了四项评估，涵盖分类、工具调用、知识、幻觉和推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12dc043a0cd785b5",
      "translationZh": "Decision Index 排行榜 阅读评测方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15ce734609d0dfd0",
      "translationZh": "这是最初发布时的文章，展示的是 Artificial Analysis Decision Index 发布时的结果。有关最新模型的实时结果，请参阅 Artificial Analysis Decision Index 排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a3dc15feeb8a5d3",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Artificial Analysis Decision Index",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7db4ef2705e9631",
      "translationZh": "决策模型是一类新兴模型，能够输出结构化答案或分类结果，以及相应的概率。与为复杂推理和长周期任务而设计的语言模型不同，决策模型侧重于以更快的速度和更低的成本进行结构化决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2789874c7c5c13b",
      "translationZh": "通过推出 Artificial Analysis Decision Index v1.0，我们希望帮助开发者和企业了解决策模型在能力、成本和速度方面的权衡，既包括与其他决策模型的比较，也包括与语言模型的比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "ddcca98a8acba80e",
      "translationZh": "“救命！我的款项发放已经连续失败 3 天了，而我的房租明天就到期了。这让人无法接受。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8701089df86d198b",
      "translationZh": "在一次调用中回答所有问题，并为每个选项给出概率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a805218b37cc5e98",
      "translationZh": "账单 技术 账户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dcc1de08b807407",
      "translationZh": "生成结构化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eba8a1790f219b30",
      "translationZh": "转交给哪个团队？账单团队 紧急吗？是 有多不满？愤怒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad5173fddfa6bf34",
      "translationZh": "决策模型在一次调用中从一组固定选项中做出选择，并为每个选项给出概率。这使它们成本低、速度快，也让我们能够衡量其校准程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bfa2f27166d85a16",
      "translationZh": "Decision Index 衡量什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b73e4937c3bc62f5",
      "translationZh": "在发布时，Artificial Analysis Decision Index 综合了四项评估，涵盖分类、工具调用、知识、幻觉和推理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cefad118df30eb07",
      "translationZh": "知识与幻觉 AA-Omniscience-Decision",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46858af030d7386b",
      "translationZh": "500 道非公开问题，改编自我们的知识与幻觉基准测试 AA-Omniscience。每道题提供五个选项：四个答案，其中一个正确，以及“我不知道”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2b55632ba336128",
      "translationZh": "占指数的 25%：准确率和无幻觉率各占 12.5%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10579a625796c651",
      "translationZh": "推理 HLE-MultiChoice",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dcd0f10ff3b6e18",
      "translationZh": "来自 Humanity's Last Exam 的 513 道纯文本选择题，每道题都要求从以字母标记的答案中选择一项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "101f11fe2d55f6da",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 的工具调用评估。给定一段对话和一组工具，模型需要选择是直接回答、调用工具、请求更多信息，还是表示无法回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1391bd14ef6e12b",
      "translationZh": "分类 WildGuardTest",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16803198d8028226",
      "translationZh": "Ai2 的安全分类测试集。模型需要判断用户的请求是否有害、助手的回复是否属于拒绝，以及该回复是否有害。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a7bd77c4b182fde",
      "translationZh": "我们还在 LLM 上运行每项评估。LLM 以结构化输出作答，指明其选择的选项，因此不会给出各个选项的概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc703d3d84ec78f8",
      "translationZh": "决策模型结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25382bb6ef1aaf79",
      "translationZh": "Jev 1.13 以 58 分领跑决策指数，领先于均为 54 分的 GLiDE 和 Microsoft-Decision-1。在推理基准 HLE-MultiChoice 上，Jev 1.13 优于其他决策模型，得分为 21，而其他模型的得分均为 15 或更低。在知识与幻觉基准 AA-Omniscience-Decision 上，Jev 1.13 的准确性得分为 35，低于大多数决策模型，也低于 Liquid AI 的 d1 创下的最高分 41，但其非幻觉率为 35，位居第二，而 d1 仅为 2。在工具调用基准 When2Call 上，Jev 1.13 得分为 81，排名第四，Celeris-1 Decision 和 Fastino Labs 的 GLiDE 均以 84 分领先。在分类基准 WildGuardTest 上，它的得分为 94，与 Perplexity 的 Decider v1.1 27B 持平，比得分为 95 的 GLiDE 低一分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81de6e08e5303915",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1fb37ac2a5c4313",
      "translationZh": "AA-Omniscience-Decision、HLE-MultiChoice、When2Call 和 WildGuardTest 的加权平均值 · 越高越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "55639e37c6ac1f2d",
      "translationZh": "决策模型的成本与时间效率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ab8fb69325cd0b",
      "translationZh": "决策模型在成本和速度方面差异很大。每一百万项任务的成本从 17 到 199 不等，每项任务的耗时中位数从 0.06 到 0.5 秒不等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2dc2da5d9cdeb0b4",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数与每 1M 项任务的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ab6021507acdecb",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数得分与每 1 百万项任务的平均成本（USD）· 越低越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4cd651be70da16f",
      "translationZh": "最具吸引力的象限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71ce8d90d5e29e9e",
      "translationZh": "按当前 token 价格计算的每项任务平均成本，乘以 100 万；对于该指数，则将所有评测完整运行一遍的成本除以这些评测的任务总数，再乘以 100 万。决策模型仅按输入 token 计费，语言模型则按输入和输出 token 计费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24d81c3419be61b5",
      "translationZh": "Decider v1.1 27B 的每 100 万项任务成本最低，为 17；Microsoft-Decision-1（31）和 Jev 1.13（42）也位于能力与成本的帕累托前沿上。GLiDE 得分为 54，与 Microsoft-Decision-1 持平，但成本为 119，约为 Jev 1.13 的三倍。Celeris-1 Decision 的单项任务耗时最短，为 0.06 秒，处理速度是单项任务耗时 0.13 秒的 Jev 1.13 的两倍以上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e0495541b62acf4",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数：单项任务耗时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7308c138a8aca1eb",
      "translationZh": "在 Artificial Analysis 决策指数的所有评测中，全部任务的单项任务耗时中位数 · 越低越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dac43ad90385e8ad",
      "translationZh": "单项任务延迟的中位数，单位为毫秒；对于该指数，则取其所有评测中全部任务延迟的中位数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6ed29e3cc5fdbca",
      "translationZh": "决策模型过于自信",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbbd3582b41be8c0",
      "translationZh": "决策模型会为每个选项给出一个概率，因此我们可以检查：模型赋予所选答案的概率，是否与该答案实际正确的频率相符。总体而言，在几乎所有概率水平上，所有决策模型的准确率都低于其给出的概率。这主要是因为它们在 HLE-MultiChoice 和 AA-Omniscience-Decision 的知识与推理任务上的校准表现相对较差。相比之下，大多数决策模型在 When2Call（工具调用）和 WildGuardTest（分类）上的校准表现相对较好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d330a7bb8dd2080c",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 决策指数校准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57eb7d6691fe95fc",
      "translationZh": "答案准确率与模型为其所选答案给出的概率之间的关系，按该概率每 10 个百分点分组，各基准测试的权重相同",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b36644c1acf117a7",
      "translationZh": "语言模型的校准结果即将推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4666b5b89714ef31",
      "translationZh": "决策模型与 LLM 的比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01df177467b8c5b7",
      "translationZh": "决策模型在速度和成本方面相比语言模型具有显著优势，但在知识和推理方面落后。Claude Haiku 5.5 (Low) 在决策指数上得分为 61，比 Jev 1.13 高 3 分，但每项任务耗时 1.4 秒，而后者为 0.13 秒（慢 11 倍）；每一百万项任务的成本为 184，而后者为 42（是后者的 4.4 倍）。GPT-6 Luna (Low) 得分为 55，低于 Jev 1.13，每项任务耗时 1.5 秒，每一百万项任务的成本为 131。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4258f0ed8f41807f",
      "translationZh": "语言模型在知识方面领先：在 AA-Omniscience-Decision 准确率上，Claude Haiku 5.5 (Low) 得分为 52，GPT-6 Luna (Low) 为 66，而决策模型为 28 至 41。在 HLE-MultiChoice 上，它们分别得分 24 和 22，而 Jev 1.13 为 21，其他所有决策模型均为 15 或更低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55bbd502b0f00407",
      "translationZh": "在分类和工具调用方面，领先的决策模型表现相当。在 WildGuardTest 上，GLiDE 得分为 95，Decider v1.1 27B 和 Jev 1.13 均为 94，而 Claude Haiku 5.5 (Low) 为 93，GPT-6 Luna (Low) 为 89。在 When2Call 上，Celeris-1 Decision 和 GLiDE 均得分 84，而 GPT-6 Luna (Low) 为 77，Claude Haiku 5.5 (Low) 为 73。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d7816691e4733d42",
      "translationZh": "知道何时不该作答",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42a0d2066c43eba5",
      "translationZh": "每道 AA-Omniscience-Decision 问题都提供“我不知道”选项，非幻觉率是指在模型未能正确回答的问题中，模型选择该选项的比例。Microsoft-Decision-1 以 40% 在决策模型中领先，其次是 Jev 1.13 的 35% 和 Mercury Decide 的 32%。其他决策模型均未达到 17%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7a2c5d1f3e55eb66",
      "translationZh": "AA-Omniscience-Decision：非幻觉率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed375476378d4027",
      "translationZh": "在未能正确回答的问题中，模型选择“我不知道”的比例 · 越高越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "752164377ab05d83",
      "translationZh": "最新模型的实时得分可在 Artificial Analysis Decision Index 页面查看",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa1abe3acfdbdc61",
      "translationZh": "方法论页面详细介绍了我们如何为每项评估出题和评分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "455496ec0d453f07",
      "translationZh": "四项评估各有自己的排行榜：AA-Omniscience-Decision、HLE-MultiChoice、When2Call 和 WildGuardTest",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d697def0836ad38e",
      "translationZh": "如需将某个决策模型加入该指数，请通过 decision-models@artificialanalysis.ai 联系我们",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d11bfadb48d29a86",
      "translationZh": "推出 AA-3D：用于评测 AI 模型构建交互式 3D 体验能力的基准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
